<PolicyLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="Information about cookies and similar technologies used by The Curious Brain Toolkit website.">
  <p>This website does not currently use analytics or advertising tools, or provide accounts, a shopping basket or an on-site checkout. Its pages do not set cookies through site code.</p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>Links to Etsy and Instagram open services operated by those providers. If you visit them, they may use cookies or similar technologies under their own policies. Their settings do not form part of this website.</p>

  <h2>Hosting and future changes</h2>
  <p>The hosting service may use technical cookies or other storage to deliver and protect the site; this depends on the service and its configuration. If analytics, embedded content or other tools are added to this website, the information here may change.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
